    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM present to the market this beautifully appointed four bedroom end of terrace residence situated in this hugely popular, established and very convenient location within a 10 minute drive of Limerick city centre. There are wonderful local amenities within walking distance such as Childers Road Retail Park, Parkway Shopping Centre, Claughaun GAA Club, the new Bon Secours Private Hospital, Educate Together Secondary School and St Bridgets Primary School. Public transport is also readily available together with easy access to the Motorway.\nThis property has been maintained to a very high standard offering very well proportioned and bright living and bedroom accommodation. No. 18 also enjoys extensive off street parking with a deep and spacious front driveway. An ideal home for first time buyers, right sizers or investors. Inspection of this superb home which is very much in turnkey condition is very highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway\n\nSitting room - 4m (13'1\") x 3.9m (12'10\")\nLaminated flooring. T.V point.\n\nKitchen/living/dining room - 6.3m (20'8\") x 5m (16'5\")\nLaminated flooring. Recessed lighting.\n\nDownstairs bedroom - 3.6m (11'10\") x 2.7m (8'10\")\nLaminated flooring. T.V point.\n\nShower room - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.3m (4'3\")\nTiled flooring. Triton electric shower.\n\nUtility room - 1.7m (5'7\") x 1.3m (4'3\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.1m (10'2\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\nLaminated flooring. T.V point. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m (11'6\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nLaminated flooring. T.V point.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m (10'6\") x 2.4m (7'10\")\nLaminated flooring. Built in wardrobe.\n\nShower room - 1.9m (6'3\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\nFully tiled. Triton electric shower.\n\nStore room - 2.1m (6'11\") x 1.7m (5'7\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Very convenient residential location. </li><li> Spacious and well laid out living and bedroom accommodation. </li><li> Just 10 minute drive to Limerick City. </li><li> Public transport at your doorstep. </li><li> High-quality contemporary finishes throughout. </li><li> Double glazed UPVC windows. </li><li> Attractive low maintenance paved rear area. </li><li> Large paved driveway providing ample off-street parking. </li><li> Private enclosed rear space. </li><li> Oil fired central heating</li></ul>"
      },
      {
